            <p style="color: var(--text-muted);">
                Motivated M.Sc. Computer Science graduate student with a focus on Data Analytics, computer vision, and Python development. Skilled in leveraging data processing tools and analytical problem-solving to uncover actionable insights, perform real-time data analysis, and support data-driven decision-making.
