            </div>
            <div class="edu-item" style="margin-top: 15px;">
                <div class="item-header">
                    <span class="item-title">Full Stack Python Developer Certification</span>
                </div>
                <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem; margin-top: 4px;">
                    Completed training in core Python programming, data structures, control flow, and object-oriented concepts.
                </p>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; Shubham Ramdas Thube. Built with HTML & CSS.</p>
